<title>USA: PremiumWear sets special distribution.</title>
<headline>PremiumWear sets special distribution.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PremiumWear Inc said Tuesday its board of directors declared a special distribution totaling an aggregate $12,500,000 from its 1996 sale of trade names and trademarks.</p>
<p>The distribution per share will be between $5.17 if all 203,400 outstanding options are exercised and $5.64 based on 2,215,028 shares currently outstanding.</p>
<p>The distribution will be payable on March 5 to shareholders of record as of February 19.  </p>
<p>&quot;This special distribution is in line with the payment projected in our proxy statement mailed to shareholders last August,&quot; Thomas Gleason, chairman and chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
<p>PremiumWear markets Munsingwear brand knit shirts and other apparel items.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
